    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DepthLess does not follow a traditional story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Instead, it delivers a deeply atmospheric experience \u2014 a descent through surreal, decaying environments filled with disturbingly unnatural creatures and oppressive silence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no dialogues, cutscenes, or exposition.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every step forward leads you deeper into environments that become increasingly abstract, corrupted, and hostile.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The real narrative is your journey downward \u2014 facing the unknown, solving subtle spatial puzzles, and surviving a world that clearly wasn't made for humans.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no traditional story in DepthLess.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Instead, the experience itself is the story \u2014 a wordless descent through isolated architecture, shifting environments, and your own perception.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With every fall, the world becomes more distorted.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no narrator, no cutscene. Only space, sound, and your decisions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >**rapidly press R and Spacebar** to move forward.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It might feel tricky at first, but once you get used to it, it becomes much easier!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DepthLess does not follow a traditional story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Instead, it delivers a deeply atmospheric experience \u2014 a descent through surreal, decaying environments filled with disturbingly unnatural creatures and oppressive silence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no dialogues, cutscenes, or exposition.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every step forward leads you deeper into environments that become increasingly abstract, corrupted, and hostile.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The real narrative is your journey downward \u2014 facing the unknown, solving subtle spatial puzzles, and surviving a world that clearly wasn't made for humans.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no traditional story in DepthLess.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Instead, the experience itself is the story \u2014 a wordless descent through isolated architecture, shifting environments, and your own perception.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With every fall, the world becomes more distorted.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no narrator, no cutscene. Only space, sound, and your decisions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >**rapidly press R and Spacebar** to move forward.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It might feel tricky at first, but once you get used to it, it becomes much easier!</p>",
    "short_description": "A surreal first-person platformer horror game where you descend into nightmarish architecture, solve spatial puzzles, and survive grotesque creatures.",
